WEBVTT

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:22.999
These days, no matter what I'm doing

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:27.392
His face keeps popping up

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:34.143
Twenty-four hours is chock-full of time

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:39.196
But he's tied it all up

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:45.172
Now, I'm gonna start working

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:51.177
But he always gets in my way

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:56.317
I'm a really, really, really, really hard worker

00:00:56.689 --> 00:01:01.889
But I was already under his spell

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:07.176
No matter what I'm doing, I can't help
but think about him

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:12.331
And my mind is filled with him

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:19.455
| just can't do anything now
unless he's there for me

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:26.351
He's always there inside me,
me, me, me, me, me, me

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.361
Second Semester

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:41.666
Man, we sure had a lot
of fun this summer!

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.432
But I still don't feel like
we had enough fun.

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:48.336
You're so lucky, Miyu,
you have a boyfriend.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:52.502
| was alone again this
summer after all.

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:58.117
Aya, how are you doing?

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:02.415
With Otohata, the mole's poked her
head out from her burrow, right?

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:12.374
Say, even if you are a mole,

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:14.867
you should come out to look
at the sun once in a while.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:19.836
Yeah, you're right.

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:24.771
| shouldn't stay underground all
the time, just because I'm a mole.

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:33.195
Well, I went near the record store
that Otohata works at,

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:37.700
but I didn't know what I would say
if I saw him, so in the end...

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:40.136
Oh, come on, for real?

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.071
| asked you this at Odaiba too,

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:46.442
but it's not like Otohata said
he doesn't like you, right?

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:50.579
If he said he didn't like me,
I'd be in bed at home right now!

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:54.049
Quit doing that pure girl thing!
It's giving me goosebumps!

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:56.619
| think there's hope in that case, you know.

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:58.187
Really?

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:01.824
But I haven't caught sight of Otohata
these past couple of days.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:06.376
Oh, I saw him DJ'ing at the CD store, HWV.

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.443
Really?

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:10.332
Information fee,

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:13.736
| kinda don't have my
summer break homework done.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:17.390
Ran, I thought you got Second Place
to help you out yesterday.

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:21.600
The thing is, I forgot my math notebook...

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.438
Naka-teach...

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:31.136
Kotobuki!

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:32.555
Certain Victory ¥ Go! Go! — Sports Fest

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:35.558
Certain Victory ¥ Go! Go! — Sports Fest
"Certain Victory - Go! Go! - Sports Fest"

00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:37.482
Certain Victory ¥ Go! Go! — Sports Fest

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:41.752
Aya, this is the place where
Otohata's DJ'ing.

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:46.435
Entry prohibited!

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:47.870
Kotobuki prohibited!

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:50.039
Approaching Rei is super-prohibited!

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:52.361
| see you're here, Tan Face Trio.

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:55.377
Prohibited! Prohibited!
Super-prohibited!

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:55.511
Shuddup!

00:03:55.535 --> 00:03:57.230
Prohibited!
Shuddup!

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:06.635
Rei is so cool!

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:12.528
Who's that?

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:14.111
Beats me.

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:24.173
Crushed!

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:25.207
What's with that girl?

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:26.790
Uber pissed!

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:28.978
Aya?

00:04:29.002 --> 00:04:29.912
Aya!
Aya?

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:30.494
Aya!

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.164
Here.

00:04:35.475 --> 00:04:36.943
Then I'll take it!

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:39.502
Ran, you're so insensitive!

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:42.875
Honestly!

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:45.327
Looks like I've been definitively rejected.

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:48.530
Hey, come on, are you getting all blue again?

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:53.469
Don't tell me you've decided
that girl is Otohata's girlfriend?

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:55.104
But...

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:58.574
I've never seen him smile like that
when he's talking to a girl.

00:04:58.598 --> 00:05:01.844
In the end, an introverted girl like me

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:06.032
is surely just a burden for Otohata.

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:09.952
Well, of course.

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:13.822
| bet not many guys would
go for a wallflower like you.

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:15.457
I'm not you!

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:18.815
| can't be positive all the time like you are!

00:05:19.218 --> 00:05:22.965
How can you say such mean things
to me when you know that already?!

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:25.959
I'm being totally honest with you
because we're good friends!

00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:30.825
Do you like yourself the way you are,
always badmouthing yourself?!

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.010
| hate it.

00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:38.881
Aya, you're asking for too much if
you want someone to like you

00:05:38.905 --> 00:05:42.535
when you don't even like yourself.

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:46.588
First, you have to get to like yourself.

00:05:46.612 --> 00:05:49.240
And then, always be honest
when you go for it.

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:51.674
Those are the ironclad rules for gals, right?

00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:53.696
Ran...

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:57.179
A girl's gotta have guts! Go for it
before you start brooding over it!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.272
A girl's gotta have guts.

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:04.764
| can't hear you!

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:09.262
But you know, Ran really doesn't
have much in the way of problems.

00:06:09.736 --> 00:06:11.580
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:15.617
Don't be stupid, I've got problems too.

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:19.054
| lost one of my favorite
faux nails recently.

00:06:19.078 --> 00:06:21.156
| missed "Shibuyan" on TV yesterday.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.325
And I don't get enough allowance.

00:06:23.349 --> 00:06:25.094
Let's see, what else?

00:06:25.118 --> 00:06:26.528
| guess that's about it.

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:28.630
Do those count as problems?

00:06:28.654 --> 00:06:30.588
What about your summer break homework?

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:37.306
Well, we suddenly went
on an overseas trip

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.061
and I participated in the
Running of the Bulls in Spain!

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:44.279
But the bull I grabbed onto went wild,
ran all the way to India,

00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:47.950
and charged into the Ganges River,
where I ended up adrift,

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:50.500
and I finally drifted into
Tokyo Bay this morning!

00:06:50.576 --> 00:06:51.270
Exclusively for
Ran Kotobuki

00:06:51.344 --> 00:06:55.591
You can't make it back from the
Ganges River to Tokyo Bay in one day!

00:06:55.615 --> 00:07:00.062
Really, I don't know how you come up with
these stupid excuses time and time again.

00:07:00.086 --> 00:07:03.784
So? Why did you really forget to do
your summer break homework?

00:07:06.426 --> 00:07:07.951
| was goofing off.

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:12.988
Your teacher just sincerely wants you
to advance to the next grade.

00:07:13.733 --> 00:07:18.068
Cheer up, Naka-Teach. Life has
its ups and downs, you know?

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:18.947
| don't want to hear that from you!

00:07:18.971 --> 00:07:20.449
I'm against violence!
| don't want to hear that from you!

00:07:20.473 --> 00:07:21.099
I'm against violence!

00:07:23.843 --> 00:07:25.470
Hey...

00:07:26.813 --> 00:07:28.490
Don't run in the hallway.

00:07:28.514 --> 00:07:30.482
Excuse us, Mr. Gunjo.

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:34.897
Just the man I wanted to see.

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:37.633
Here's the daily class practice
schedule for the sports fest.

00:07:37.657 --> 00:07:39.625
Oh, thank you.

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:43.572
Is it me, or does your class

00:07:43.596 --> 00:07:46.327
get a rather large share of time on the field?

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:48.043
What of it?

00:07:48.067 --> 00:07:52.080
Well, it would have been nice if you had
asked about our preference beforehand.

00:07:52.104 --> 00:07:53.782
Pardon me for that.

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:57.753
It's just that, unlike my class,
which wins every single year,

00:07:57.777 --> 00:08:02.257
your class somehow comes in last
every year, so I couldn't help it.

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:04.147
<i>Quit jumping to conclusions.</i>

00:08:05.918 --> 00:08:08.785
Kotobuki, watch your language.

00:08:09.322 --> 00:08:13.589
Mr. Nakanishi, it must be tough to be the
homeroom teacher of such a problem child.

00:08:14.026 --> 00:08:16.620
Well, please notify me of your
schedule preferences later.

00:08:19.866 --> 00:08:22.767
What the hell is up with his attitude?!
Uber pissed!

00:08:23.469 --> 00:08:25.380
The sports fest...

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:29.466
I'd love to win it just once before I retire.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.255
I've visited shrines, eaten cutlet bowls,

00:08:33.279 --> 00:08:35.591
and bought good luck pendants,

00:08:35.615 --> 00:08:37.626
but none of it ever worked.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.015
Naka-Teach...

00:08:39.785 --> 00:08:41.463
If I get our class to win,

00:08:41.487 --> 00:08:44.166
would you forget about my
summer break homework?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.501
Win?!

00:08:45.525 --> 00:08:49.571
Your P.E. grade certainly was
head and shoulders above the rest.

00:08:49.595 --> 00:08:51.874
And you've got leadership skills too.

00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:54.142
All right, I'll consider it!

00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:55.177
For real?!

00:08:55.201 --> 00:08:56.278
All right!

00:08:56.302 --> 00:09:01.717
Leave this upcoming sports fest
to the victory contractor, Ran Kotobuki!

00:09:01.741 --> 00:09:05.041
The crown of victory shall rest upon
the brows of Year 1, Class 2!

00:09:09.815 --> 00:09:10.158
Scavenger Race Spoon Relay
Three-legged Race Girls' Class Relay

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:11.159
Scavenger Race — Spoon Relay — Three-legged Race — Girls'
Class Relay — The spoon relay's gonna be Mizunumal!

00:09:11.183 --> 00:09:12.776
Scavenger Race — Ohtani Spoon Relay — Mizunuma Three-legged Race
— Girls' Class Relay — The spoon relay's gonna be Mizunumal!

00:09:13.019 --> 00:09:14.748
Next, there's the three-legged race.

00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:16.899
We'll need two people
in tune with each other.

00:09:16.923 --> 00:09:19.101
Isn't Ran super-fired up?

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:21.321
Sports fest, what a pain.

00:09:22.562 --> 00:09:24.030
It's settled! Rie and Satsuki!

00:09:24.931 --> 00:09:26.208
Us?!

00:09:26.232 --> 00:09:28.724
All that's left is the girls' class relay.

00:09:29.201 --> 00:09:31.313
It's the last event and the point value is high,

00:09:31.337 --> 00:09:33.682
so we can't afford to lose that one.

00:09:33.706 --> 00:09:35.918
I'll be the anchor, of course!

00:09:35.942 --> 00:09:37.753
And Miyu, you up for it?

00:09:37.777 --> 00:09:41.189
Okay! Running is one of
Miyu's strong points too!

00:09:41.213 --> 00:09:42.591
You can count on me!

00:09:42.615 --> 00:09:44.413
That leaves one more...

00:09:45.785 --> 00:09:47.262
Mel!

00:09:47.286 --> 00:09:48.497
Aya?

00:09:48.521 --> 00:09:50.250
For real?

00:09:52.391 --> 00:09:55.270
Oh, Ran, I knew you were really into it.

00:09:55.294 --> 00:09:56.805
Now, I know why.

00:09:56.829 --> 00:10:00.509
He'll forget about my homework!
Of course, I'd get all into it!

00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:02.978
But man, you surprised me, Aya.

00:10:03.002 --> 00:10:05.447
You said that a girl's gotta
have guts, remember?

00:10:05.471 --> 00:10:08.907
| should talk to Otohata about
what happened the other day,

00:10:09.442 --> 00:10:11.206
but I just keep brooding over it.

00:10:12.011 --> 00:10:14.446
So, I made a promise to myself.

00:10:15.081 --> 00:10:19.746
If I can win the relay, I might get
the courage to talk to Otohata.

00:10:20.186 --> 00:10:21.163
Aya...

00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:22.698
Was it inconvenient?

00:10:22.722 --> 00:10:26.335
No way! It'll work out better when
all three people get along!

00:10:26.359 --> 00:10:28.537
That's right! Even if you're a little slow,

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:31.223
we'll cover for you, so leave it to us!

00:10:32.164 --> 00:10:32.975
Okay!

00:10:32.999 --> 00:10:35.978
By the way, that omelet looks good!

00:10:36.002 --> 00:10:36.867
Gimme!

00:10:37.203 --> 00:10:38.898
It's majorly good!

00:10:39.939 --> 00:10:44.720
Well, you know, Bro said that
your omelets are good, so...

00:10:44.744 --> 00:10:48.578
What?! Really?! Oh, Yamato!

00:10:54.987 --> 00:10:55.731
Listen up!

00:10:55.755 --> 00:10:59.001
Our class is gonna win this year's
sports fest, no matter what!

00:10:59.025 --> 00:11:02.791
What we need to win is unity,
support, and a fiery spirit!

00:11:03.295 --> 00:11:04.773
And our catchphrase is...

00:11:04.797 --> 00:11:04.806
Guys gotta have guts! And girls gotta
have guts too! And our catchphrase is...

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.173
Guys gotta have guts!
And girls gotta have guts too!

00:11:05.197 --> 00:11:07.943
Guys gotta have guts! And girls gotta have guts too!
Guys gotta have guts! And girls gotta have guts too!

00:11:07.967 --> 00:11:08.092
Guys gotta have guts!
And girls gotta have guts too!

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:10.512
Ran, why are you so
fired up about this?

00:11:10.536 --> 00:11:13.301
Isn't it kinda lame to be getting
fired up like this?

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:16.866
There's definitely something to this!

00:11:18.477 --> 00:11:19.755
Ran?

00:11:19.779 --> 00:11:22.749
The truth is, Naka-Teach is sick.

00:11:24.216 --> 00:11:29.798
So, I thought he might get better
if we won the sports fest.

00:11:29.822 --> 00:11:31.133
Naka-Teach is sick?

00:11:31.157 --> 00:11:32.768
| had no idea.

00:11:32.792 --> 00:11:35.090
It started when his case of
athlete's foot got aggravated!

00:11:36.762 --> 00:11:38.890
Sorry for being late!

00:11:40.066 --> 00:11:41.309
What's wrong, everyone?

00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:44.880
Mr. Nakanishi, we'll win, no matter what!

00:11:44.904 --> 00:11:46.281
What's our catchphrase?!

00:11:46.305 --> 00:11:49.366
Guys gotta have guts!
And girls gotta have guts too!

00:11:49.909 --> 00:11:51.638
You guys...

00:11:52.044 --> 00:11:54.056
All right! Let's all do our best!

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.457
Right!

00:11:55.481 --> 00:11:56.792
Success!

00:11:56.816 --> 00:11:58.360
Isn't that overdoing it a little?

00:11:58.384 --> 00:12:01.149
But the class is unified now...

00:12:02.988 --> 00:12:04.533
The starting sprint is vital.

00:12:04.557 --> 00:12:07.049
That's an ironclad rule
for the 100m dash!

00:12:07.426 --> 00:12:09.271
Make your heart as one
and roll the ball!

00:12:09.295 --> 00:12:11.389
That's an ironclad rule for
ball-rolling!

00:12:12.164 --> 00:12:13.709
Never show your back
to your opponent

00:12:13.733 --> 00:12:15.911
and attack from any direction
except from the front!

00:12:15.935 --> 00:12:18.180
That's an ironclad rule
for the cavalry battle!

00:12:18.204 --> 00:12:20.036
<i>Ready?! Go!</i>

00:12:22.708 --> 00:12:24.335
A girl's gotta have guts.

00:12:25.778 --> 00:12:27.371
Aya!

00:12:33.886 --> 00:12:36.685
Aya, don't worry, don't worry!

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.083
That's right!

00:12:40.926 --> 00:12:42.519
Okay!

00:13:01.213 --> 00:13:02.874
Ready,

00:13:03.382 --> 00:13:04.907
Go!

00:13:06.752 --> 00:13:08.220
Goal!

00:13:17.329 --> 00:13:19.559
| thought I hadn't seen
Ran around much.

00:13:19.799 --> 00:13:21.243
So, this is why.

00:13:21.267 --> 00:13:23.145
Ran, fight!

00:13:23.169 --> 00:13:25.013
Rah! Rah! Ran-pyon!

00:13:25.037 --> 00:13:26.314
Tatsukichi?
Rah! Rah! Ran-pyon!

00:13:26.338 --> 00:13:26.648
Tatsukichi?
Oh, brother!

00:13:26.672 --> 00:13:28.037
Oh, brother!

00:13:49.662 --> 00:13:51.289
A girl's gotta have guts.

00:13:51.664 --> 00:13:52.460
Aya!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.942
Aya!

00:14:08.514 --> 00:14:10.425
Aya!

00:14:10.449 --> 00:14:12.076
Ran!

00:14:12.551 --> 00:14:14.383
Off I go!

00:14:21.961 --> 00:14:23.554
Goal!

00:14:28.901 --> 00:14:30.712
This is youth.

00:14:30.736 --> 00:14:33.228
Class 2 certainly is
enthusiastic this year.

00:14:34.773 --> 00:14:36.218
Mr. Gunijo...

00:14:36.242 --> 00:14:41.089
But I find your decision to make that
problem child the captain rather questionable.

00:14:41.113 --> 00:14:43.925
It's true that it isn't entirely uncontroversial,

00:14:43.949 --> 00:14:47.062
but Kotobuki is very popular
among the kids in the class.

00:14:47.086 --> 00:14:49.130
| suppose all I can say is
that it's very like you,

00:14:49.154 --> 00:14:51.851
since your teaching principle is to
let them be free and unrestrained.

00:14:53.158 --> 00:14:55.337
Well, it will probably be
impossible for you to win,

00:14:55.361 --> 00:14:57.329
but you just do your best.

00:14:59.465 --> 00:15:01.934
Why, that Gunjo!

00:15:05.404 --> 00:15:07.182
It's finally tomorrow.

00:15:07.206 --> 00:15:10.437
Ran, Miyu, thank you.

00:15:10.709 --> 00:15:13.255
Aya, you showed a good deal
of guts out there.

00:15:13.279 --> 00:15:14.956
You made a promise after all.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.792
You can make a go at Otohata
after the sports fest.

00:15:17.816 --> 00:15:20.161
Take your honest feelings
and go for it!

00:15:20.185 --> 00:15:20.762
Okay!

00:15:20.786 --> 00:15:21.696
Ran!
Okay!

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:22.297
Ran!

00:15:22.321 --> 00:15:24.199
Hey!

00:15:24.223 --> 00:15:27.769
It feels so good! That's the Second
Place I know! Always so thoughtful!

00:15:27.793 --> 00:15:30.138
You'll come see us at the
sports fest tomorrow, right?

00:15:30.162 --> 00:15:32.574
They're having fireworks after
the closing ceremony too!

00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:33.742
<i>Of course!</i>

00:15:33.766 --> 00:15:34.542
Fireworks!

00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:38.799
| love fireworks! Of course,
I'll come! Ook! Ook!

00:15:39.371 --> 00:15:42.773
Bring Otohata with you.
Definitely! No matter what!

00:15:43.142 --> 00:15:45.987
